# Exalted Sunborn: "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are created
# instead" (CR 614.1a, 111.1). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 for {3}{W}{W} (Black Lotus's white and two Moxen), a 4/5 with flying
# and lifelink. Bot2's Lingering Souls on turn 2 makes just its two Spirits (the refusal: they are not under Bot1's
# control); Bot1's own Lingering Souls on turn 3 makes four (the positive control).

